    -- CW override: always fast/synchronous actions. The non-fast
    -- path registers on_nth_tick closures dynamically; an error in
    -- one is a non-recoverable mod error that kills the server
    -- (observed live). Walking gets a static queue processor when
    -- move_to is ported.
    storage.fast = true
end
